awaii in the Pacific Ocean. The United States also asserts sovereignty over five major island territories and various uninhabited islands in Oceania and the Caribbean. It is a megadiverse country, with the world's fourth-largest total area and third-largest population, exceeding 341 million.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"US"}],"arc":{"reports":63,"first_seen":"2026-10-09T09:00:00Z","first_title":"Trump slashes tariffs to flood U.S. with 661 million pounds of foreign beef — Nebraska ranchers push back","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOTjJYSnRtdnlPT1pGWkVpN1ljTTF3emdfaWpfR1hXREJRRVRWU3VqSlpJZ0ZSZlhDYlUyUTFQeFQ1UmhvMEU4OFRGUEZtSi1LRWZaSENSWDFCeUNFR1dnckJPcXFmZW04bHNyWmNJdDNvd1pfZFF0bWhOZzFrWXhId19WTGZ2Q25FQWdVSGtOM2hRV1QxVVlOMy13?oc=5","first_publisher":"Yahoo Finance","earlier":[{"id":"e_78400bb1c37b","title":"Trump doubles down on Canadian tariffs as businesses struggle","date":"2026-10-17T00:27:03Z","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","publisher":"FOX 13 Seattle","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_809be464e69e","title":"Supreme Court invalidates most of Trump's tariffs - ABC News","date":"2026-10-17T02:04:34Z","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","publisher":"ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_82f9ddfd8837","title":"Video | Trump Waives Russia-Linked Tariffs, But India's Russian Oil Trade Remains Under Watch","date":"2026-10-17T05:09:17Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQUDZPYTdRWnlYbklYNDl0enhtZUE0VDhVcmw1Vm9FQjU0bGVrLVRUZ2JXc2lheURHTm9jdEdnUFNEenhQVGlSWkRiRGhYWVpZRmZ1akZLTTZGczVVWEdXUHJXOC1sWklTSzBYdGdKYkpuTnBtUFZ5Sk1COHdPbUV4RzhpWmxjdENvZGJxVUxBRmlFZFVCT09TZkdEOXBiSGxSaEo0N2J2SzBvNEttZHZvZ1BldlQ5NlhNbGRJ?oc=5","publisher":"NDTV","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_f9aeffbf265c","title":"Shafaq News..Trump waives tariffs tied to Russian energy purc